{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>日本汽車照明設備廠商小糸製作所正加快調整產品設計與生產方式，希望到2030財年將車燈製造成本降低約30%，以應對來自中國供應商的競爭。</strong>讓這家日本老牌車燈企業感到壓力的，是中國同行的價格。目前部分中國廠商的車燈產品比小糸便宜約三成，小糸副社長內山正巳坦言，中國的價格已經成為行業對標標準。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587638.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:03:50.890760+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:50:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.447429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:57:10.447429+00:00","content_hash":"a11acdf4e19d395f3c1a10df36462941c99ce6642df675a081f63bd129c879f1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}